2026-06-14 18:55:04.438 | INFO     | app.services.set_service:get_text_for_set:257 - [GET TEXT] Final result text: At the old theater, Maya sought sophistication, hoping her performance would feel perfect.  
Her disguise was simple, but the rehearsal revealed how hard it was to stay an entity.  
She wanted to aspire beyond fear, and every rehearsal pushed her toward a better solution.  
The director praised her sophistication, yet asked for a perfect smile behind the disguise.  
